/results/

# Comparison experiment data lives on HuggingFace, not in git.
# Git holds only the app/toolkit (src/, runners/, docker/) and the
# comparison.example.json template. Real comparisons/ dirs are user data
# provided at runtime and pushed to HF separately.
comparisons/
# Published analysis reports (writeups for completed comparisons) also go to
# HuggingFace/markdown, not git — same rationale as comparisons/ above.
older_comparisons/

